Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）来吧 呼唤出来吧 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！ 现身吧 No.39！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.11,0:00:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）霍～普！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马用了 No.怪兽！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那家伙明明约好不用的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}航空鲨 直接攻击！ 大食者！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 输了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再跟我扯上关系了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧… 明明用了 No.怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 特殊召唤UFO龟！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（UFO龟）咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就用我我我魔术师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击UFO龟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.26,0:01:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）游马同学这个人真是让人搞不懂呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输成那样的话，换作是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一段时间内可是振作不起来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！？攻击力提升？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，游马君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是没有自尊心这回事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.59,0:01:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）用UFO海龟攻击我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）这下20连败了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，居然还有魔法卡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～再来一次！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还有干劲啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可是以决斗冠军为目标的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，尽管放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真受不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那委员长，接下来轮到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:02:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！等等啊！铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没想到游马
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会是那种家伙。那场决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙明明说过不会用 No.卡的……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可他居然……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过你看，游马那家伙就是个笨蛋嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道他是笨蛋啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马是笨蛋，又爱得意忘形{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但唯独撒谎他是绝对不会的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞，来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（银二）鲨鱼偶尔也一起干一场呗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:03:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（银二）大哥，那个叫鲨鱼的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不能想想办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别让他太得意了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）你根本不懂啊，银二。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我们是真心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他当同伴的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）那家伙在决斗的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好歹也算是个有点名气的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把他驯服了，让他当里决斗界的明星的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算什么都不干也有钱进账。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）得让他好好给咱们赚钱才行啊。嘿嘿嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞，上吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.57,0:05:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男，今天也来跟我决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经不会再跟你决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少说这种小气话！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手是除了你以外　要多少有多少！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你　不管和谁战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都不可能赢下决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的战术很拙劣这倒是一直如此{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在的你连那种拙劣的战术都没有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫无意义地只是在不断重复攻击而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你烦躁的原因在于鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他确实是个很出色的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也很有才能。　但是他能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不只是因为这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你什么意思啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他把你的卡组研究透了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后针对 No.卡的弱点下手。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你又了解他的什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}了解什么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼参加全国大赛的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能发生过什么事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说从那时候起，鲨鱼就开始变坏了不过也只是听说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（银二）真的要干吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王）那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种机会可不会有第二次了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看，瞧瞧这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次展览会的压轴展品这副超稀有卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}长期以来下落不明，但{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前几天在美术馆获赠的物品当中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被偶然发现这次终于得以公开展出。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！我超想要这副卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可、可是，这不是很糟糕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.51,0:06:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然要从美术馆偷东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的会进监狱的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王）那又怎样！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙不是一直都说吗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“想干一票大的”！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这个嘛，话是这么说没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别担心。我们可是有这家伙跟着呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）Numbers……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大哥说得没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自从得到这家伙之后什么事都随心所欲。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能会被抓啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们啊，可是被这卡的力量保护着的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（银二）可、可是大哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？你不想干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（银二）啊，不是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在那干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你都听到了那你也得掺一脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然，你会跟我们一起去的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵……啊啊，无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，那就定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}行动就在今晚！给我准备好明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（海王和陆王的笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:08:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了……真的糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再怎么说这次也……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完蛋了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}趁现在，从这座城里滚出去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？你、你要放我逃走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧给我滚！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯…… 咦 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇怪了 这个 打不开啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）查资料？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马居然来图书馆还真是少见呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“决斗怪兽全国大赛”？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 稍微查点东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.77,0:08:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“玷污的夺冠热门 神代凌牙”。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这说的是鲨鱼的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的过去……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）“夺冠热门的神代凌牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偷看对手的卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在全国大赛决赛中被取消资格……”。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈 哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼居然偷看对手的卡组什么的……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事肯定是假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 在图书馆里……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙和我的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不是 会做那种事的家伙该有的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.59,0:09:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！黑枪 枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈 哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你！在鲨鱼那儿……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈 哈……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼他 抢卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 大哥他们说要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去袭击美术馆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是那张卡害的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从得到那张卡的时候起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大哥他们 就像变了个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且大哥他们一定{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算把全部罪名都推到鲨鱼身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，那家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.15,0:10:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再这样了，别再和鲨鱼扯上关系了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须去…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须得去才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？为什么要为了鲨鱼做到这种地步。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不是为了鲨鱼才去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是为了我自己才去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对自己撒了谎。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘴上说是为了让鲨鱼脱离
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.31,0:10:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实我是想赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是因为想赢才用了 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，我不甘心！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不甘心就这么结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银二那家伙 跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管他。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.61,0:10:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 那混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 算了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:11:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就当是 这家伙说要来干活嘛。 对吧？

Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊！？ 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里往前 我不会让你过去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 就是上次那个 刺头小鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想从这里往前去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就先在决斗中打倒我再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是你们赢了……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的 No.卡就给你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《要赌上 No.卡吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 如果我赢了就别对美术馆出手。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那玩意儿和我们的卡一样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊这家伙叫 No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和我这两张就有这么大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是把那玩意儿弄到手我们可就无敌了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧。陆王 海王。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 打算二对一打吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那当然。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会让你去抢卡的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我应该说过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再跟我扯上关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能放着不管。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这些家伙只是在利用你而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 那种事我知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我已经只有这里才是我的容身之处了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对。你的容身之处不是这种地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会放弃的。这次一定要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你说出和这群家伙断绝关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.27,0:12:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少自以为是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要做到这种地步？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为是同伴啊，这还用说。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要。我不去。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马确实撒了谎。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但他现在正拼命地想要去战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样下去好吗？你们是朋友吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 闲聊到此为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然牵扯到 No.卡的话那就另当别论了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不是二对一。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就3对1来打吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意。2个人也好3个人也好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.93,0:13:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了。我站这家伙这边。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，是要背叛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别搞错了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是当腻了这些家伙的保镖而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。你是说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要向我们挑战组队决斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是群蠢货。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变成什么样你心里有数吧？凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻我就拿下了。　我的回合　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以里侧守备表示盖放一只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻嘻。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　看那样子，对方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对组队决斗很熟练。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞　接下来是我的回合。　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤刷拉拉骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（刷拉拉骑士）刷啦啦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我来干一场。　对里侧守备怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动攻击。　上吧　刷拉拉骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在组队决斗中，必须所有玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都结束一个回合之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊？那就回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菜鸟一个。这场决斗轻松拿下。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤飞机头暴雪龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在组队决斗中无敌的我们……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢向我们发起挑战我会让你后悔的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤大鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.81,0:15:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大鲨鱼）鲨～。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再特殊召唤鲨鱼踢球者。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在鱼族怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.07,0:15:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽有两只。要来真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的大鲨鱼和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼踢球者叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，潜航母舰 航空鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.27,0:16:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（航空鲨）吼～。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一回合就超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然厉害啊，鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动怪兽效果。一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一张自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对手造成400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最初的回合虽然不能攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但效果伤害的话就能造成。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是4张。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此造成1600点伤害给陆王。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔噢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，搞定了。嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵。就知道你会来这招。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。发动陷阱卡。暴雪蛋 等级5。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在效果伤害发生时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从受到伤害的玩家手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤1只等级5的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是无法特殊召唤的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那名玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陆王的手牌里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果没有等级5的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再受到500点伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个危险的赌注。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级5　等级5啊……　呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}我将等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}级{\fnYusei Magic}5的盆唐・熔岩蜥{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}（盆唐・熔岩蜥{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}龙{\fnYusei Magic}）{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}嘎{\fnYusei Magic}～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来轮到我了。　陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}烈焰蛋　等级5！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到效果伤害时我方玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将1只等级5的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:17:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是若无法召唤的场合
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级5的猛犸·冰堡龙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.95,0:18:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他也同样拥有等级5的怪兽吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧…一口气竟然两只全都特殊召唤出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看到了吗我们完美的配合。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们兄弟在组队决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是无人能敌的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.64,0:18:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？他们那份绝对的自信。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 有什么不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那些家伙 难道说…》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 凌牙！发动陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瞪眼 等级5！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在于自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只等级5的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.49,0:18:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.53,0:18:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有2只等级5的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 伤害是1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧 叛徒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 没什么大不了的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放2张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这到底是怎么回事？ 这场决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明都没攻击生命值却 哗哗地掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话这场决斗 可赢不了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗关系到鲨鱼和我的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不能输啊》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将里侧守备怪兽改为攻击表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，拳击火焰恐龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双人决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.37,0:19:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么游马和鲨鱼会一起！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:20:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动拳击火焰恐龙的翻转效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的等级提升1级变为等级5。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级5的拳击火焰恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和短裤熔岩恐龙进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.61！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火山恐龙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！这就是那家伙的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，大哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下 就是我们的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.89,0:20:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识见识我们真正的恐怖吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:21:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}火山恐龙 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过消耗1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予对方玩家该怪兽攻击力数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏空气鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}岩浆爆发！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 吃下空气鲨攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1900点的伤害吧 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还有闲心担心别人？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 轮到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏刷啦啦骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}岩浆爆发！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.81,0:21:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……好强的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}见识到了吧，我们的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.卡，我们收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.73,0:22:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（陆王／海王）哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗，开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这3种陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让对手吃瘪吧！

